UID:e033c443f9280c3fd28ac7afd894b3e3@growthzone.com
DESCRIPTION:Come celebrate 80 years with Healthy Petaluma! For 80 years He
 althy Petaluma has been advocating and supporting the health needs of ever
 yone is Southern Sonoma County. In celebration\, we invite you to join us 
 for an evening honoring our shared history. Schedule: 4:30pm | Arrival & R
 efreshments 5:30pm | Kick-off Video & Remarks 5:45pm | Community Award Pre
 sentation 6:00pm | Mingle & Reminisce
