BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Closing Cocktails: Illumination in Glass
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261017T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261017T200000
UID:95efae8543fb777223ccfabe0fc3b1fe@growthzone.com
DESCRIPTION:ONE LAST GATHERING • CLOSING COCKTAILS All things must come 
 to pass—and Maria Isabel Lopez closes this chapter with a heart full of 
 gratitude. Join us for one last peek at Lopez’s mosaics\, one last eveni
 ng to celebrate Illumination in Glass\, and the beautiful journey this exh
 ibition has been. Some pieces have already found their homes\, while a few
  are still waiting for the right home to find them. Come raise a glass wit
 h us as Kabayan Wines pours their beautiful wines\, accompanied by live mu
 sic and good company. Closing Cocktail Saturday\, October 17 • 5–8 PM 
 Usher Gallery\, Petaluma Come for the art. Stay for the wine and music. An
 d help us celebrate this chapter before the lights go down.
URL:https://business.petalumachamber.com/events/details/closing-cocktails-
 illumination-in-glass
X-SOURCE:Petaluma Chamber of Commerce
END:VEVENT
