UID:abb7b296513e2d124157293d5496cdea@growthzone.com
DESCRIPTION:PEF Business Breakfast Club: Estate Planning with Miranda Dres
 sler Join Petaluma Educational Foundation and estate planning attorney Mir
 anda Dressler for a conversation about the roles of a trustee and an agent
  under a durable power of attorney\, how they differ\, and choosing the ri
 ght person for each role. Enjoy coffee\, pastries\, networking\, and Q&A. 
 Networking begins at 8:30 a.m.\; presentation starts at 8:45 a.m. Free and
  open to all.
