DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261022T190000
UID:589d8a118fdb8032a6564ffc7462054c@growthzone.com
DESCRIPTION:An intimate journey with whales from around the world\, and to
  help carry that journey north. Join Firuze for an Enchanting Show at Kell
 er Street CoWork on Thursday\, October 22\, at 4:30 PM. Prepare for an int
 imate exploration of whales from across the globe\, and help carry their j
 ourney northward. Each piece begins with sound\, drawing inspiration from 
