 cks\, belugas\, and sperm whales. From this auditory foundation\, the artw
 ork transforms into a visual experience: the vocalizations of these magnif
 icent creatures expressed through color\, line\, and layered form. This ex
 hibition also serves as a fundraiser for my upcoming Arctic residency with
  The Arctic Circle\, where I will be sailing to Svalbard in the spring of 
 2027.
